{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAOS &amp; CO: GOOD LUCK BEING EMPLOYEE OF THE WEEK!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just been hired at the most unpredictable store in the multiverse, where your job is to craft and sell iconic items to an endless line of wannabe heroes; all while your appliances come alive, your coworkers panic, HR ignores you, and Friday looms like a final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive a week in retail hell?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT ICONIC ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble and sell classic adventuring essentials - swords, treasure maps, magic flowers, cloaks of invisibility, and more - to a cast of \u201cheroic\u201d customers with high expectations.<br>The crafting stations have minds of their own, so you\u2019ll need to strategize, multitask, and adapt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/c7a924ad7378e57f7f6d187f2e331421.poster.avif?t=1767882529\" width=1170 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/c7a924ad7378e57f7f6d187f2e331421.webm?t=1767882529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/c7a924ad7378e57f7f6d187f2e331421.mp4?t=1767882529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAME YOUR APPLIANCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every appliance has its own personality\u2026 and bad habits. <br>Keep them happy to improve efficiency, unlock handy automation, and stop that one appliance from wandering off mid-shift for yet another coffee break. Between picky customers and emotionally unstable hardware, it\u2019s hard to tell who you\u2019re working for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/058ee4a360eb326e5ad7f99b69bef1ab.poster.avif?t=1767882529\" width=1170 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/058ee4a360eb326e5ad7f99b69bef1ab.webm?t=1767882529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/058ee4a360eb326e5ad7f99b69bef1ab.mp4?t=1767882529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEEP THE STORE RUNNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your week, juggle customers and chaos, and brace yourself for the Friday rush.<br>Serve your hero-bound clientele without letting your rebellious appliances (or your coworkers) drive you insane. Each day is a new balancing act between meeting corporate quotas and total collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/a62f46e76163dab294a8dfcefba6c6ba.poster.avif?t=1767882529\" width=1170 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/a62f46e76163dab294a8dfcefba6c6ba.webm?t=1767882529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/a62f46e76163dab294a8dfcefba6c6ba.mp4?t=1767882529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ROGUELITE REPLAYABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every week at Chaos &amp; Co is different!<br>Upgrade your equipment, rearrange your setup, and optimize your workflow to face escalating chaos! Discover new appliances, store layouts, items to craft, and unpredictable events with each run. Perfect your routine, beat your previous profits, or embrace the madness all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/8d3b0f56c722c758015fb18cce3779c6.poster.avif?t=1767882529\" width=1170 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/8d3b0f56c722c758015fb18cce3779c6.webm?t=1767882529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/8d3b0f56c722c758015fb18cce3779c6.mp4?t=1767882529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLO OR CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your store alone or with up to 4 players in online or local co-op. <br>Coordinate shifts, share tasks, and argue about why the hammer is missing\u2026 again.<br>Teamwork is optional. Deadlines are not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/44a62bba489d939ad559cea514e78505.poster.avif?t=1767882529\" width=1170 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/44a62bba489d939ad559cea514e78505.webm?t=1767882529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/44a62bba489d939ad559cea514e78505.mp4?t=1767882529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online and local co-op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft iconic gear for adventurers of all kinds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame mischievous appliances (or suffer their tantrums)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan, upgrade, and optimize your store layout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face new challenges and events each week</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelite structure packed with humor, replayability, and strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3454860?t=1767882529","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/c65f787053fff3b701e0c48b751b1f0e468f45de/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767882529","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/4195840e570d90b226c7b7499a908ecbd2eaad7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767882529","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/4195840e570d90b226c7b7499a908ecbd2eaad7e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767882529","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAOS &amp; CO: GOOD LUCK BEING EMPLOYEE OF THE WEEK!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just been hired at the most unpredictable store in the multiverse, where your jo